@startuml coupon-merchant-stats-activity
title 查看和统计优惠券

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
  DiamondBorderColor #3B82F6
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #EF4444
  ArrowColor #475569
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  TitleBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
}

|商家|

start

:进入店铺券管理;

:分页查询店铺券列表;

:查看券统计;

|优惠券服务|

:校验商家身份;

:查询本店数据;

:组装统计结果;

|数据库|

:查询模板与状态流水;

|商家|

:展示统计结果;

stop

@enduml
